<title>ITALY: Strike will disrupt Italy flights on Friday-unions.</title>
<headline>Strike will disrupt Italy flights on Friday-unions.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A planned one-day national strike called by engineering trades unions for Friday is likely to severely disrupt Italian air travel, the unions said.</p>
<p>Maintenance engineers and technicians are due to down tools at all Italian airports for their normal three eight-hour shifts running from midnight local (2200 GMT) Thursday to midnight (2200 GMT) Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Serious delays and cancellations of scheduled fights can be expected,&quot; a union statement said.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
